      <p>The development of the modern world is impossible without the development of the scientific sphere. This indicates the need to consolidate and provide it not only to specialists in various fields of scientific life who have knowledge in these areas, but also to a wide range of readers in order to allow them to have an idea of what changes are taking place in the world.</p>
